			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Reduce lock contention; notify Cocoon on config change\n\n**Lock contention fixes** — In `ScanAndPopulateExtensions`, replace the N-insert\nloop under `ScannedExtensions` lock with a single pointer-swap (`*Guard = All.clone()`),\nreducing lock hold time from 100–500 ms to a clone duration. In `DiagnosticProvider`,\nsnapshot the `DiagnosticsMap` under the lock then aggregate outside it, so concurrent\n`SetDiagnostics`/`ClearDiagnostics` calls are not blocked during serialization.\n\n**Cocoon config notification** — After a successful configuration value write in\n`UpdateValue`, fire a `configuration.change` Vine notification to `cocoon-main` so\nextensions' `ConfigCache` invalidates the affected key and re-primes on next access.\nWithout this, `workspace.getConfiguration().get(key)` returns stale cached data until\nthe next full re-merge notification.\n\n**Cleanup** — Group `SkyEvent` import into existing block in `UpdateValue`; collapse\n`TextfileSave` import paths; fix `AppMenu` and `FileWriteNative` formatting.",
			"SHA": "7018ff29e26f00125ebe80f2482765bbdb842202"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-20T05:20:43Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1574,
				2
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Fix StorageProvider race and Cocoon-connect boot latency\n\n**StorageWriteDebouncer race** — Reorder the flush loop to take the pending\nitem before clearing `FlushScheduled`, so a concurrent `Queue()` call\ncannot observe the flag as `false` and the slot as empty, scheduling a\nno-op flush.\n\n**Scope-correct debouncer** — Select `GetWorkspaceDebouncer` for workspace\nscopes instead of always routing through the global debouncer, preventing\na workspace bulk-save and global bulk-save from sharing the same pending\nslot.\n\n**Dev-log noise suppression** — Add `file:open`, `file:close`, and\n`textFile:save` to the low-level noise skip list. These fire once per file\nduring project-open cascades and once/second per dirty file for auto-save\nintent, polluting IPC logs without diagnostic value.\n\n**Cocoon-connect boot latency** — Remove the 3-second blocking\n`WaitForClientConnection` from `languages:getAll` and\n`languages:getEncodedLanguageId` handlers. Tokenizer calls\n`getEncodedLanguageId` synchronously on first editor open. With the old\nwait, the worker stalls for up to 3 s before Cocoon is available. Return an\nempty fallback array immediately when Cocoon isn't connected; the workbench\nretries on next keystroke.",
			"SHA": "920f9dc6bbda677a2de6d3018582afbb14de5b26"
		}
	],
